          "name": "Lost, Stolen or Damaged Paycheck",
          "instructions": [
            "<div>Manual Check requests received b<span style=\"font-size: 0.85rem;\">y Close of Business Monday to Thursday will be processed on the following day.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.85rem;\"><br></span></div><div>Manual Check requests received b<span style=\"font-size: 0.85rem;\">y Close of Business on Friday will be processed on Tuesday.</span></div>",
